- Confirm Aerosil's scope-selection (Class 1/2A bounds) is unaffected.
- Confirm any document where page 1 already names the material correctly (e.g. Evonik's own declarations, IFF's PRDS) is unaffected — the fallback must never override a correctly-extracted page-1 name.
